'''Mini Angel Cyclone''' (ミニエンジェルサイクロン, ''Mini Enjeru Saikuron'', '''Mini Angel Cyclone''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[Divine Cyclone]] that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. She was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

