==Trivia==
*Mini Angel Cyclone appears to be based on [[Wikipedia:Seraph|Seraphim]]: high-ranking and extraordinarily powerful divine beings whose jobs it is to serve and worship God at His throne.
**Seraphim can be best described as "winged beasts"—often depicted with many eyes—whose very presence purifies evil by a burning and all-consuming flame, much like Mini Angel Cyclone.
***Her [[Mini-Surge]]s may have been inspired by this idea.
*Mini Angel Cyclone and [[E-792]] are the only [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclones]] who are confirmed to be female.
*She has the highest movement speed of all Cyclones and is tied with [[Divine Cyclone]] for the fastest attack rate out of all Angel enemies.
*Ironically, Mini Angel Cyclone has longer range than Divine Cyclone.
*Most of her stats include or can be divided by the number 4, which in Japanese is known as the number of death.

